<h1>Using the resourcepool class</h1>

<p>The <a href="../classes/html/classresourcepool.html">resourcepool class</a> provides a pool of objects.  Objects can be borrowed from and returned to the pool.</p>

<p>The pool contains a configurable minimum number of objects that are allocated when the pool is initialized.  When all of those objects have been borrowed, the pool can allocate a configurable number of additional objects on-demand, up to a configurable maximum.</p>

<p>The pool is a template class, parameterized by the type of object it contains.</p>

<p>The resourcepool class is targeted for use with the MVC classes, but it can be used in non-MVC projects as well.</p>

